    <artifactId>healthcore-starter-biobanking</artifactId>
    <name>Opes HealthCore Starter — Biobanking &amp; Biospecimen Repository (ISO 20387-Aligned)</name>
    <description>
        Independent biobanking and biospecimen repository starter aligned with ISO 20387 technical
        controls: pseudonymous donor consent &amp; withdrawal, freezer/rack/box/slot coordinate mapping,
